---
title: "CMM Operation and Programming"
code: "MAC-134"
category: "machine-technology"
credits: "2"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Focuses on inspection using a Coordinate Measuring Machine. Includes hands-on demonstration of CMM setup, initialization and operation. Covers the essential aspects of the software and CMM operation, using a sample part for hands-on practice. Lecture 1 hour. Lab 2 hours. Total 3 hours per week. Additional course fee applies.
